Market Challenges
EUV pellicle inspection requires highly sensitive instruments capable of handling delicate membranes without causing contamination or mechanical damage. Developing reliable measurement systems and integrating them into specialised manufacturing environments can involve substantial technical complexity.

Market Restraints
The limited number of dedicated pellicle manufacturing and qualification facilities restricts the potential customer base. High equipment costs, long technical acceptance processes and capital spending concentrated among a small number of specialised buyers may also affect annual procurement.

